                                "sense_id": "9285aad8-dd02-3413-ac95-36f9863f720d",
                                "text": "The college system protects you, but it is very unfair to say that people at Oxbridge are not living in the real world. They do have some odd slang. ‘I'll p-hole you in the plodge’ meaning ‘I will leave a note for you in the porter’s lodge’ is just one example."
